    "customfield_12313320": "<div style='font-weight:bold;color:red;text-align:center'>This project has a <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/discussion.html\">user mailing list and an IRC channel</a> for support. If you are looking for support, or if you are not sure whether the behavior that you are observing is expected or not, please discuss it there first.</div>",
    "customfield_12314134": null,
    "duedate": null,
    "customfield_12314132": null,
    "customfield_12314131": null,
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12536396/comment/13176008",
          "id": "13176008",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150"
            },
            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "here's 2 tests, one for the old impl, one for the new one:\n\nIn this case we have national hockey league = nhl.\n\ndesired behavior:\n||token||posIncr||startOffset||endOffset||\n|national|1|0|8|\n|nhl|0|0|*22*|\n|hockey|1|9|15|\n|league|1|16|22|\n\ncurrent behavior (FST impl):\n||token||posIncr||startOffset||endOffset||\n|national|1|0|8|\n|nhl|0|0|*8*|\n|hockey|1|9|15|\n|league|1|16|22|\n\nold impl:\n||token||posIncr||startOffset||endOffset||\n|national|1|0|22|\n|nhl|0|0|22|\n|hockey|1|0|22|\n|league|1|0|22|\n\nFrom the offsets perspective, nhl is only getting the offsets of national (endoffset=8) but it would be bettter if it got endoffset=22.\n\nUsing the old impl imo is no workaround, the offsets are crazy (each individual word gets 0-22). But i think we should just leave it be and try to improve the new one.",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150"
            },
            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2011-12-26T20:16:30.830+0000",
          "updated": "2011-12-26T20:16:30.830+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12536396/comment/13176053",
          "id": "13176053",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=koji",
            "name": "koji",
            "key": "koji",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506"
            },
            "displayName": "Koji Sekiguchi",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Tokyo"
          },
          "body": "Thank you for opening this issue, Robert!\n\nbq. Using the old impl imo is no workaround, the offsets are crazy (each individual word gets 0-22).\n\nGood point. Using old impl, if I search for national, the whole phrase of \"national hockey league\" is highlighted.\n\nbq. But i think we should just leave it be and try to improve the new one.\n\n+1",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=koji",
            "name": "koji",
            "key": "koji",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=koji&avatarId=36506"
            },
            "displayName": "Koji Sekiguchi",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Asia/Tokyo"
          },
          "created": "2011-12-26T23:45:14.327+0000",
          "updated": "2011-12-26T23:45:14.327+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12536396/comment/13179506",
          "id": "13179506",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Patch; I think it's ready.\n\nI fixed the syn filter to set the start/end offset only when the right-hand-side of the rule has a single token; else, it does what it did before (inherit start/end offset from the single input token the output is \"on top of\").",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
